  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 104.03 Public Access to Records. Any individual who wishes to request information or access to council records shall do so in accordance with Plc 104.\n\nSource. #7412, eff 12-5-00; ss by #14496, eff 2-8-26\n\nAppendix",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid100.html"
